{"id":"965681a90864b053","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-gap-sentence-property.md","title":"极小固定点gap的阶段性质","display":"lem-gap-sentence-property — 极小固定点gap的阶段性质","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-gap-sentence-property","aliases":["91-lem-gap-sentence-property","91-lem-gap-property"],"display":"lem-gap-sentence-property — 极小固定点gap的阶段性质","depends_on":["[[91-df-gap-sentence]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-gap-sentence-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-gap-sentence-property</span><span>91-lem-gap-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gap-sentence-property — 极小固定点gap的阶段性质"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"10229cf1ace7edd3\" href=\"?note=10229cf1ace7edd3\" title=\"91-df-gap-sentence\">91-df-gap-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-gap-sentence-property-—-极小固定点-gap-的阶段性质\">lem-gap-sentence-property — 极小固定点 gap 的阶段性质</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\\)</span>、\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(C_T))\">\\(\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(C_T))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X:\\eta\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\">\\(X:\\eta\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\\)</span>、\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min}=X_\\kappa\">\\(X_{\\min}=X_\\kappa\\)</span> 均采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_\\alpha\\coloneqq X_\\alpha\">\\(\\Gamma_\\alpha\\coloneqq X_\\alpha\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\eta\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\eta\\)</span>）；因此\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa+1&lt;\\eta\">\\(\\kappa+1&lt;\\eta\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_\\kappa=X_{\\min}\">\\(\\Gamma_\\kappa=X_{\\min}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>；\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"10229cf1ace7edd3\" href=\"?note=10229cf1ace7edd3\" title=\"91-df-gap-sentence\">91-df-gap-sentence</a> 的句子集定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gap\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\n\\to\n\\forall\\alpha\\leq\\kappa\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_\\alpha\n\\land\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_\\alpha\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gap\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\n\\to\n\\forall\\alpha\\leq\\kappa\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_\\alpha\n\\land\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_\\alpha\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>阶段序列递增且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_\\alpha\">\\(\\Gamma_\\alpha\\)</span> 都包含于闭包阶段\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_\\kappa\">\\(\\Gamma_\\kappa\\)</span>。因此若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 或其否定的编码在某个早期阶段进入，它也会\n留在闭包点；对闭包点 gap 的定义取逆否命题即得结论。</p>\n<p>这里的 gap 明确相对于从空集生成的极小固定点。它不意味着该句在其他\n固定点也无真值；真理陈述者在极小固定点中是 gap，却能在其他一致\n固定点中取得真或假。</p>\n<p>来源：原书 §15.1 的极小固定点构造；本结论由其递增阶段包含关系直接推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-gap-sentence-property-—-极小固定点-gap-的阶段性质","text":"lem-gap-sentence-property — 极小固定点 gap 的阶段性质","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-gap-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"10229cf1ace7edd3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-gap-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)$、\n$\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(C_T))$、$X:\\eta\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)$、\n$\\kappa$ 及 $X_{\\min}=X_\\kappa$ 均采用 [[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]。","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-gap-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"10229cf1ace7edd3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}$；\n$\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}$ 采用 [[91-df-gap-sentence]] 的句子集定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(C_T))","display":false},{"tex":"X:\\eta\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\min}=X_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_\\alpha\\coloneqq X_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha<\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa+1<\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_\\kappa=X_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gap\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Gap}_{X_{\\min}}\n\\to\n\\forall\\alpha\\leq\\kappa\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_\\alpha\n\\land\n\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin\\Gamma_\\alpha\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1704,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-gap-sentence-property]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-gap-sentence-property]]"}],"outgoing":["10229cf1ace7edd3","460308c7099a8386"]}